Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:22.52,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you for coming today to the HKT48 Ishibashi Ibuki Solo Event,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ibu-con Final.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.97,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,We truly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:31.44,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Before we begin, we have a few requests for our audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:37.08,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,During the show, except when truly necessary, please do not stand on your chairs or leave your seats,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:43.66,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and please do not do anything that would disrupt the show — it's dangerous and a nuisance to other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:49.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Bringing in or using cameras or recording equipment is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.80,0:06:53.27,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,If you have any with you, please leave them with our staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:58.43,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please also set your phones to silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:05.58,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Food and smoking are strictly not allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:11.16,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,You may bring in drinks for hydration,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but please use a container with a lid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:17.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and be considerate of those around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:23.02,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,For today's staging, we will turn off the emergency guide lights in the seating area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:26.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,In the event of an emergency, the lights will be turned on and staff will guide you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:29.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but please take a moment now to note the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:34.46,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone — Ibu-con Final is finally about to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:36.66,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Are you ready to get loud?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:41.82,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Can you give me lots of Ibuki calls?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.08,0:07:47.74,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm a little nervous, but I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.34,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,That was Ishibashi Ibuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:50.68,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,We'll be starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.82,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Just hang on a little longer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:58.26,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, Ibu-con Final has begun—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.18,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Is Ibuki cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.76,0:13:01.72,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:04.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Huh? I'm not getting a "cute" from all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.50,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I can barely hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:08.64,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Is Ibuki cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:09.98,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:12.08,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,You pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:31.41,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, Ibu-con Final is getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.49,0:22:32.91,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Are you all fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:38.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.13,0:22:39.63,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,First of all, we just had you listen to four songs:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:40.85,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Waruki,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.43,0:22:42.51,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Hatsukoi Butterfly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:44.61,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Baby! Baby! Baby!,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:47.71,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and Hatsukoi Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:50.95,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,There's no photo time, so
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.37,0:22:54.05,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:56.73,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,This is the costume they made for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:22:58.93,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,at the graduation ceremony in Aichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.97,0:23:04.20,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.41,0:23:04.73,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.83,0:23:09.39,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I was really looking forward to spending this wonderful day with all of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.47,0:23:10.61,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but I'm so nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:13.44,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so please blow my nerves away with your calls!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:17.04,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.73,0:23:22.43,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wait, I haven't introduced myself, have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:26.31,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Here we go. When I point the mic at you, say "Ibuki—!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.13,0:23:29.29,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ibu-ibu-ibu-ibu—?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:32.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:34.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'll blow a new wind into HKT.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.88,0:23:38.23,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm Ishibashi Ibuki, from Fukuoka, and I love kickboxing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.90,0:23:49.36,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Alright — so after this, there's still more to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.44,0:23:54.44,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and I know some of you came to see our guests,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.52,0:23:58.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but I think it's a bit early for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:01.94,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so just listen to this audio for a little longer and wait for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:03.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm going — wait, I've got a costume change, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.00,0:24:05.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Here I go! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.52,0:24:09.38,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.13,0:24:10.93,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'll just set the mic down for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.01,0:24:11.49,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.75,0:24:13.87,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Um, I'm running — go, Ishibashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.95,0:24:15.05,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,You can do it, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.98,0:24:17.74,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, so,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:19.38,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I've reached the dressing room, so
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.46,0:24:21.38,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm going to take my makeup off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:22.88,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wait, wait, wait, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.96,0:24:25.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm going to change costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.64,0:24:27.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,This yellow costume is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.62,0:24:28.24,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:29.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,The back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.38,0:24:31.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,The back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:34.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.97,0:24:36.83,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Makeup-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:38.64,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Makeup-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:39.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:42.02,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I want these hairpins taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.58,0:24:42.94,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.62,0:24:45.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,That feels better. I want a tissue too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:47.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.50,0:24:50.86,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh no, a hanger, a hanger, a hanger!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.70,0:24:53.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ah, it's tangled, it's tangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:55.44,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.52,0:24:55.87,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.95,0:24:56.30,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.38,0:24:56.73,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.81,0:24:57.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.92,0:25:03.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm sweating so bad I want to fix my makeup too, so the costume change— ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.70,0:25:04.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,The dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.08,0:25:04.44,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,The back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.52,0:25:05.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Could you close it one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:06.88,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.90,0:25:15.04,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, I want to fix my makeup for a second, but wait on the costume change too, okay? Makeup touches matter, they matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.82,0:25:23.24,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh, I might be cute. Let me wipe this sweat first. Let me wipe it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.80,0:25:25.48,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.78,0:25:27.18,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Uh-oh, everyone hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.26,0:25:30.04,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ibuki still wants to come back out for a bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.12,0:25:30.70,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:33.88,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wait, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:35.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Maybe I'll have a piece of candy or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:38.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, get your voices ready for Ibu-con!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.56,0:25:44.28,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh, that sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.86,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, let me hear more of those calls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:49.78,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Were you looking forward to Ibu-con?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.20,0:25:52.30,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:54.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:57.06,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I was looking forward to it too, so
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:59.90,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,in the middle, for the unit block as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.98,0:26:02.52,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I want us all to enjoy it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.14,0:26:05.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I've been talking too much, I need to catch my breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:09.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so I want to come out in about fifteen seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:15.50,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,One, two, three, four, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.26,0:26:18.20,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Actually, I can't wait, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.34,0:26:19.48,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I want to come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:21.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Now, our next song—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:23.30,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.98,0:31:20.52,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,To Ibuki, who I love so, so, so, so, so, so much—
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.07,0:31:24.36,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Congratulations on your graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.97,0:31:32.99,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I, Ryu, wrote a letter for Ibuki, so please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:43.45,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Ibuki, congratulations on your graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:49.10,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Today, Ibuki, you are the sparkliest idol in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:53.02,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Thank you for taking such good care of Ryu all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.82,0:31:57.12,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I hope you'll be happy forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:53.70,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,When I was lonely and full of anxiety,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.78,0:36:55.80,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,you gently reached out your hand to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.88,0:36:58.24,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thanks to you, Ibuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.32,0:37:01.46,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,I made so many fun memories it barely feels real.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.08,0:37:05.43,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thank you so, so much for being such a good friend to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.94,0:37:09.76,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,From here on, please let me keep the right to be your kouhai and your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:11.10,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,We're friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:54.52,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So, we just presented a unit block,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.60,0:40:56.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and I had everyone come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.94,0:41:00.30,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.74,0:41:01.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.25,0:41:05.57,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I started by picking songs I wanted to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.73,0:41:08.11,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and then who I wanted to do them with,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.21,0:41:10.57,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and for this Ecstasy, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.69,0:41:13.77,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I really wanted to dance my heart out,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.85,0:41:17.71,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so among everyone, I went with the ones it would suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:20.59,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Maria-chan and Saa-chan, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.83,0:41:27.36,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I chose them thinking, "This would look good on her," or "I want to sing this with this girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.00,0:41:29.25,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:36.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So now, we'd like to take a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.78,0:41:39.14,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Hiiro, that was fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.22,0:41:40.82,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.90,0:41:42.43,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,She cried, she did, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:44.94,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Wait, that was sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.02,0:41:46.26,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,It was sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.34,0:41:47.90,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, let's take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.38,0:41:51.33,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,A little further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.52,0:42:00.48,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Everyone, shall we sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.56,0:42:01.68,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Let's all sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.84,0:42:04.49,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,What pose do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.72,0:42:06.14,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,First, a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.41,0:42:12.35,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,And next...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.72,0:42:21.14,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Do a pose that looks like something Ibuki would do!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.22,0:42:21.62,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Ehh—
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.61,0:42:23.65,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.73,0:42:27.03,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'll make sure I don't do the same one as everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.00,0:42:29.84,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.92,0:42:31.12,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ready, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.06,0:42:38.84,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.92,0:42:40.27,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wait, let me see, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.00,0:42:42.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.76,0:42:45.90,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Is this the pose you all think I'd do!?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.92,0:42:47.12,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,It's this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.54,0:42:49.07,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm definitely not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.45,0:42:51.64,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Because in rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.02,0:42:52.80,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,she got embarrassed,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.88,0:42:55.92,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and it's always that one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.14,0:42:58.06,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Well, anyway, never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.95,0:42:59.95,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.05,0:43:00.95,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:03.96,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Wow, but that's love, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.04,0:43:04.57,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.28,0:43:07.46,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm happy, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.40,0:43:10.20,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Alright, I'm going to go change,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.28,0:43:12.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so I'd like all of you to keep the MC going.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.64,0:43:13.92,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,That was suddenly kind of sloppy, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.00,0:43:14.62,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.76,0:43:15.94,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay, please take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.02,0:43:16.67,Default,All,0,0,60,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.46,0:43:23.64,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,So then, from here, I'll take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.78,0:43:25.94,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,That was so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.72,0:43:29.32,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Okay, first — Maria, do you have a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.44,0:43:29.79,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.87,0:43:34.86,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Ibuki and I often go out to eat after a show or a live,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.40,0:43:39.94,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and if we've got half-twintails in, we'll just go to dinner with the half-twintails still in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.02,0:43:42.16,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,And something happened because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.24,0:43:44.84,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Because we had half-twintails or twintails in,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.92,0:43:49.36,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I think the server figured we must be somebody,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.44,0:43:53.18,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and they came over and asked, "Are you in some kind of entertainment?"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.26,0:43:56.02,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Ibuki and I were there with friends too, so
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.10,0:43:59.16,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,we were like, "No, we're not," and lied about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.24,0:44:02.08,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and they went, "Wow, you really look like you are,"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.16,0:44:03.66,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and they just kept building it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.74,0:44:08.12,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and said, "You're going to be a big star someday, so give me your autograph,"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.20,0:44:11.58,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,and all of a sudden we were being asked for autographs as regular people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.66,0:44:12.64,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.72,0:44:18.00,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,We were so shocked, and then I signed a completely different name.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.34,0:44:16.84,Default,Yuuna,0,0,105,,Of course you wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.88,0:44:19.90,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,That's so weird. That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.98,0:44:21.92,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,So it's sitting in some shop somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.00,0:44:26.76,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I think it's on display in some shop as "someone who's going to be a big star someday."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.84,0:44:31.18,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,So I used a name of someone I don't even know, and wrote that autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.26,0:44:32.61,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,That's not okay, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:35.90,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,It might actually be on display.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.98,0:44:37.30,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,It might be on display somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.38,0:44:37.94,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,That's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.02,0:44:39.10,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,I want to go see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.18,0:44:39.92,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I know, I was so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.48,0:44:41.84,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,That's just not okay, normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.92,0:44:43.52,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,That's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.60,0:44:44.78,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.06,0:44:47.66,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Okay, Hiiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.94,0:44:51.86,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,As graduation gets closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.34,0:44:53.70,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,a graduating member has
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:55.45,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,a lot of writing to do—
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.78,0:44:58.66,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,signing things for the fans, and so on,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.20,0:45:01.82,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,there's a whole lot of writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.90,0:45:03.46,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,and today too, in the dressing room, Ibuki
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.54,0:45:06.62,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,was writing so much for the fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:09.46,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,and then a manager came into the room and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.24,0:45:15.72,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,"Ishibashi has even been signing
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.80,0:45:17.58,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,the ones she's supposed to take home herself."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.66,0:45:21.64,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Even on the ones she was taking home,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.72,0:45:23.56,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,she'd signed "Ibuki."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.64,0:45:28.12,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,And I thought, that's so her, including things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.02,0:45:32.84,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,It's scary that she was turning them in without noticing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.10,0:45:34.40,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,But speaking of that, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:37.98,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,there's a gacha for Ibuki's graduation goods, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.06,0:45:40.60,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Acrylic keyholders, and can badges,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.68,0:45:43.16,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and I saw online that it was going on sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.24,0:45:44.46,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I wanted to do it so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.54,0:45:45.96,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I looked it all up online,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.04,0:45:47.18,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,but I couldn't figure out how,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.26,0:45:49.44,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and when I got to the venue today,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.52,0:45:51.64,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,the gacha machines were lined up outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.72,0:45:53.26,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,So I asked the manager,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.34,0:45:55.06,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,"I really, really want to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.14,0:45:56.60,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,could you please let me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.68,0:45:58.42,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and Ishii and I paid for it ourselves and did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.90,0:46:00.65,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,Out of our own pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.86,0:46:03.76,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I went and did it with them after that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.22,0:46:06.36,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Paid for it ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.44,0:46:08.40,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,why do you keep stressing "out of our own pockets"?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.48,0:46:09.60,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,But that does matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.68,0:46:11.54,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Stressing "out of our own pockets."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.62,0:46:17.50,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I got the one I wanted right away, and the managers around us were all like, "I want one too, I want one too," and everyone was doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.58,0:46:18.40,Default,All,0,0,60,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.76,0:46:23.38,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I, on the other hand, couldn't get the one I wanted, so I was in line with a staff member.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.46,0:46:28.81,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,The staff member got the one I wanted, and when I said that'd be nice, they traded with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.26,0:46:29.92,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,What power!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.00,0:46:31.36,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Don't do what everyone else is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.62,0:46:33.97,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I got the one I wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.46,0:46:35.75,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Did you all pull one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.94,0:46:37.00,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Did you pull one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.68,0:46:39.10,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,It was cute, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:41.56,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Lots of people are wearing them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.64,0:46:42.50,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,They really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.58,0:46:43.52,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.60,0:46:45.26,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Maria-chan, is there one you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.34,0:46:47.40,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Maria wants this one too, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.78,0:46:49.54,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Please don't try to trade for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.62,0:46:50.08,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,I won't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.16,0:46:51.84,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Don't take it, that's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.92,0:46:52.94,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Someone in the crowd really looked like she might hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.02,0:46:54.18,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,You're really into it, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.26,0:46:56.56,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,"Really into it" — you bought it yourself, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.64,0:46:58.29,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Please take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.44,0:47:00.14,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,But Ryuto's always
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.22,0:47:02.26,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,so into Ibuki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.34,0:47:02.72,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.80,0:47:06.72,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,But today, in rehearsal for Kimi to Boku no Kankei,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.60,0:47:12.42,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,in the part where she's supposed to face Ibuki, Ryuto was looking completely the other way,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.50,0:47:14.60,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,and it was like only Ibuki had a crush on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.68,0:47:18.74,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Normally they'd both be like, "this is so moving," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.82,0:47:19.80,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,This is so moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:21.64,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,If Ryuto does it, she's with Ibuki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.72,0:47:22.64,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,The same pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.32,0:47:24.22,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,No, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.28,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,I felt so bad for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.36,0:47:27.12,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,I got so nervous in rehearsal,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.40,0:47:32.04,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and for the last pose, Ibuki was like, "come on, squeeze me,"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.12,0:47:36.38,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,but I thought I was posing at the DMM camera over that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.46,0:47:39.22,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and I thought, I have to pose too, so I posed,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.30,0:47:42.77,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,and when Ibuki said "I'm heading over" and I turned around—
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.74,0:47:48.54,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,You two are close, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.62,0:47:50.15,Default,Ryuto,0,0,60,,We're close, really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.90,0:47:54.16,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,But at the same time as thinking Ibuki must be nervous,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.24,0:47:56.90,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,I wanted Ibuki to cry, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.98,0:47:57.58,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.66,0:47:59.74,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,I wanted the members to cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.82,0:48:04.08,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,and in rehearsal, everyone really did start crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:04.51,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.59,0:48:05.70,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Everyone was crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.78,0:48:08.30,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,and Ibuki was crying too, and she looked a little happy about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.38,0:48:11.22,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,but I honestly hadn't felt it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.30,0:48:12.66,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,and I was just smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.74,0:48:13.48,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.56,0:48:17.54,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Then when we got back to the dressing room, Ibuki said, with her voice shaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.62,0:48:20.16,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,"Hey, Yuuna-chan, you feel lonely, don't you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.66,0:48:22.72,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,She started to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:24.68,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,She said, "you feel lonely, don't you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.76,0:48:26.76,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,But I just thought it was cute, so
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:30.01,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,Ibuki was so cute then, wasn't she, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.40,0:48:32.54,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,She really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.10,0:48:34.38,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,And at the pre-show huddle, too—
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.46,0:48:36.96,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Ibuki says she's not nervous, but
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.04,0:48:38.28,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,she was so nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.52,0:48:42.64,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,she was talking tongue-twister fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.86,0:48:46.39,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,I couldn't quite do the impression, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.64,0:48:50.93,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,It just looked like the usual Saa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.40,0:48:54.02,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,I wonder if that's how she shows she's super nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.10,0:48:56.81,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,When she moves she was also talking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.02,0:48:57.92,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Did you all see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.00,0:48:58.48,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.56,0:48:59.06,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.82,0:49:00.92,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,That was so suspicious, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.00,0:49:03.70,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,And this Ibuki we'd never seen before,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.78,0:49:05.20,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,we got to see her today, and it was so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.28,0:49:07.02,Default,Saaya,0,0,60,,She was so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.10,0:49:09.34,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,When she was about to go on, before the opening,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.42,0:49:11.74,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,we all slapped Ibuki on the back,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:14.74,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,and I and Ryuto were a little late,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.28,0:49:17.04,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,but we got a high-five from her too,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.12,0:49:20.44,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,and helped Ibuki get pumped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.00,0:49:24.34,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,Apparently Ibuki herself
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.42,0:49:27.56,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,had been really looking forward to this Ibu-con Final,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.64,0:49:31.98,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,and even the day before she was like, "I can't wait for tomorrow," all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.06,0:49:33.92,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,but when we saw her today, she was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.00,0:49:36.88,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,I was so nervous today I couldn't sleep at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.68,0:49:38.38,Default,All,0,0,60,,That's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.46,0:49:40.22,Default,Hiiro,0,0,60,,She was apparently so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.00,0:49:43.80,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Ibuki's just about ready, so
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.72,0:49:47.60,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,everyone, do you still want to see more of Ibuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.35,0:49:53.40,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Ibu-con Final, are you still fired up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.25,0:49:57.45,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.58,0:49:59.44,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Our next song is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:00.23,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.00,0:50:10.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ibuki means twintails!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.08,0:50:12.76,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Twintails means Ishibashi Ibuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.40,0:50:16.87,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, take a good long look at Ibuki's twintails, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.86,0:57:36.48,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, from here it's smartphone photo time!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.24,0:57:40.16,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Did you all bring yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.29,0:57:42.45,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Did you put them on silent for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.06,0:57:47.20,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please get one last, extra-cute shot of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.76,0:57:48.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ah! A bunny came!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.14,0:57:51.10,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Look at this bunny — what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.18,0:57:51.96,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.66,1:00:51.14,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, photo time is over for this song.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.22,1:00:53.24,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please put your phones away.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.96,1:06:46.16,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So, that's six songs
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.24,1:06:47.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,we've had you listen to in a row—
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.88,1:06:52.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Are you all having fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.80,1:06:54.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.19,1:06:56.41,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,It's so much fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.49,1:06:57.87,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm having a blast!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.22,1:06:59.00,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:06:59.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.88,1:07:01.43,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I was kind of nervous,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.51,1:07:02.87,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but it's nothing like that at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.95,1:07:04.03,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.47,1:07:04.82,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.90,1:07:07.29,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,the bunny's kind of, from the stage,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.37,1:07:07.65,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,ah—
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.25,1:07:09.45,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,it fell off, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.53,1:07:10.06,Default,Ishii,0,0,60,,Usa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.51,1:07:10.86,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.94,1:07:12.59,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.55,1:07:15.31,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,What kind of stage is this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.39,1:07:15.74,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.82,1:07:16.73,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So then,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.81,1:07:17.63,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,from here,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.71,1:07:22.11,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,today I'd like to do a certain song.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.53,1:07:26.91,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,This one was intense — everyone really struggled to learn it,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.03,1:07:29.15,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,but you all got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.21,1:07:31.31,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So, please listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.79,1:07:32.91,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Mizuiro Altair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.02,1:10:41.24,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So, that was Mizuiro Altair.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.32,1:10:45.38,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Brings back memories, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.46,1:10:48.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,How many years ago was this song for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.54,1:10:50.42,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,Six years?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.14,1:10:52.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,When I was 16? Six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.48,1:10:58.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,About six years ago, when I played the lead in an online stage play,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.96,1:11:01.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,this was the theme song we made,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.62,1:11:03.70,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and everyone else in it has already left.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.78,1:11:06.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I was the center on this song,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.10,1:11:11.36,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,so I wanted us all to do this song I starred in, one last time,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.44,1:11:13.14,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and I had everyone learn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.22,1:11:14.18,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.18,1:11:15.77,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.22,1:11:18.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.32,1:11:23.28,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Time's flying, so
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.36,1:11:25.42,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,the next one will be our last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.58,1:11:26.28,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ehhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.81,1:11:28.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.19,1:11:31.61,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.69,1:11:33.05,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Nagori Zakura.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.82,1:14:08.30,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so much for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.51,1:14:10.10,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.45,1:14:22.05,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.86,1:22:04.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you for the encore, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.64,1:22:08.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Can we get even louder?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.54,1:22:13.28,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Let's go all the way to the end together!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.76,1:23:49.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,This is the song you voted into 3rd place.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.40,1:23:52.06,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,It's thanks to all of you that I get to sing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.14,1:23:53.42,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.50,1:23:55.64,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I love you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.12,1:29:04.22,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so, so much for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.60,1:29:10.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,There are so many things I was able to do thanks to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.68,1:29:13.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm truly happy I got to be an idol.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.00,1:29:16.18,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Look after me through tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.38,1:30:25.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Once again, thank you for the encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.86,1:30:37.06,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I joined HKT48 at thirteen, back at the start,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.14,1:30:39.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and on SHOWROOM,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.32,1:30:44.70,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'd been doing these Ibu-con streams for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.68,1:30:46.96,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Fans would tell me then
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.04,1:30:49.66,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,they'd be so happy to see it on a stage someday,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.74,1:30:50.96,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and I'd say,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.04,1:30:53.68,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,"I'll work hard so I can do that someday,"
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.76,1:30:56.42,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and now, at last, I've been able
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.86,1:30:59.56,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,to make that come true, and I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.75,1:31:01.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.84,1:31:08.80,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.88,1:31:13.70,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,After I announced my graduation, there wasn't much news about what I'd be doing,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.78,1:31:18.98,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and even so, you all kept waiting and looking forward to it, which made me so happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.66,1:31:25.58,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,and getting to be here safely, receiving so many Ibuki calls from all of you, is truly a joy.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.66,1:31:26.26,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.10,1:31:33.34,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Everyone, did you enjoy Ibu-con Final?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.06,1:31:34.65,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.46,1:31:39.30,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Did you really have fun?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.40,1:31:43.30,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.58,1:31:47.08,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I had suuuch a fun, happy time too!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.82,1:31:51.36,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,So, the next one will be our last song.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.00,1:31:55.59,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.12,1:31:59.86,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I want you all to love me even more than you did yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.94,1:32:02.78,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,And I love all of you so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.72,1:34:51.92,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so, so much for Ibu-con Final.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.08,1:35:00.60,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Tomorrow, at last, I will graduate from HKT48.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.10,1:35:03.38,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I grew so much thanks to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.46,1:35:04.96,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I've grown up, you know!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.24,1:35:09.50,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,It really was your support
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.00,1:35:13.72,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,that got me here, having so much fun, my heart so full of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.80,1:35:16.12,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please keep supporting me through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.20,1:35:17.32,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I love you all!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.48,1:36:16.12,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so much for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.90,1:36:18.65,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.68,1:36:29.88,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,In a moment, with all our gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.96,1:36:32.48,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,we will see you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.56,1:36:35.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please stay where you are until our staff guide you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.04,1:36:37.98,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Now, let's do our final greeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.00,1:36:42.08,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ready, and—
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.06,1:36:46.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Ready, and—
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.50,1:36:47.92,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Thanks for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.46,1:37:12.82,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,She's crying so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.58,1:37:16.82,Default,Yuuna,0,0,60,,In this cold costume—
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.52,1:37:18.30,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.10,1:37:21.40,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I'm just lonely.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.04,1:37:25.40,Default,Maria,0,0,60,,That was fun, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.48,1:37:26.52,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,It was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.60,1:37:29.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,I was nervous, but I totally pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.34,1:37:31.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You sure did!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.10,1:37:32.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, you did!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.50,1:37:32.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's our girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.62,1:37:35.21,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.00,1:37:47.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.44,1:37:50.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.20,1:37:53.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.06,1:37:55.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.20,1:37:58.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.10,1:37:59.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.50,1:38:03.94,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.02,1:38:07.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.32,1:38:09.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.00,1:38:10.76,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.00,1:38:12.62,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.00,1:38:14.76,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.76,1:38:20.64,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Thank you so, so much for today.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.72,1:38:23.54,Default,Ibuki,0,0,60,,Please look after me through tomorrow!
